<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  A trimmed SDMX-ML 2.1 structure message assembled from three real services, so
  one fixture covers the shapes the family actually publishes:

  * ESTAT — Eurostat: rich annotations, a `structureURL`, a colon-less UTC
    offset on its update timestamp, and no French name.
  * SPC   — Pacific Data Hub (.Stat/NSI): namespace prefixes spelled out in
    full, multilingual name and description, no `structureURL`.
  * NB    — Norges Bank: identity carried only by the URN, and no name at all.
-->
